  "description": "R-PAR-1 PAR-ORDER, SQL-J, SQL-REL: Which tied join pairs does ORDER BY (JL.k; JL.k DESC; JR.k, JL.id) return over JL INNER JOIN JR on k and over JLI INNER JOIN JRI, which pairs do TOP 5 and TOP 20 with ORDER BY JL.k return, and which groups do TOP 3 over GROUP BY k ORDER BY Count(*) and Count(*) DESC return over JL and OT5 when the counts tie (one GetRows(300) per statement)? Runs on a fresh copy of r-par-1-order opened read-only through DAO OpenDatabase in one process and one STA; each statement is opened with Database.OpenRecordset as a snapshot unless stated, and every call's result, HRESULT and DBEngine.Errors are captured.",
